✅ Implemented Features
1. 
User AuthenticationUser Registration & Login: Fully functional forms allowing users to sign up and log in securely.
Session Management: User data and IDs are saved in localStorage to maintain login state across pages.

2. Restaurant & Menu BrowsingRestaurant Listing: Displays all available restaurants with their addresses and ratings.

Menu Retrieval: Fetches and displays menu items (/restaurants/{id}/menu) tailored to each specific restaurant.

3. Complete Cart Management (Frontend & Backend)Add to Cart: Users can add food items to their cart with real-time "Added ✓" inline button feedback on the menu page.

View Cart: A dedicated cart page (/cart) that calculates sub-totals per item and displays the live grand total.

Quantity Controls (+ / -): Instant updates using interactive buttons that sync with your backend (PUT /cart/update/{cartId}).

Item Removal & Clear Cart: Ability to remove individual items (DELETE /cart/remove/{cartId}) or wipe the entire cart clean (DELETE /cart/clear/{userId}).

Stable UI Layout: Configured with unique item.cartId keys so items stay locked in place without shuffling when quantities are updated.


